# The evals of cre17_tamia.cmds, for its eval_queue.sh workers: "<ready-file>\t<command>".
# A Gemma checkpoint is ready once training has ended and fill_shared_kv has written
# kv_shared_norms.safetensors; a Qwen one once saved (trainer_state.json).
